BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 598.1149999999997 Td (navigation state \(userAnswers map\), monitors HTML5 fullscreen and Page Visibility API events,) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 585.2899999999996 Td (and handles asynchronous JSON fetch\(\) submissions.) Tj ET
