BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 542.4649999999996 Td (* Authentication & Session Gatekeeper: Custom decorators \(@login_required, @admin_required\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 529.6399999999995 Td (enforce strict role separation. Session identifiers are cryptographically signed using Flask's) Tj ET
