BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 472.3399999999995 Td (floors net score at 0.0, determines pass/fail status, and persists telemetry.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 453.51499999999953 Td (* Reporting Controller: Computes batch percentile ranks, topic accuracy metrics, and streams) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 440.68999999999954 Td (dynamic CSV rosters for university administrators.) Tj ET
