BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 397.86499999999955 Td (* Flask-SQLAlchemy ORM provides object-relational mapping, connection pooling, and) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 385.03999999999957 Td (parameterized SQL queries to prevent SQL Injection.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 0.15 0.2 0.25 rg 54.0 366.2149999999996 Td (* SQLite 3 engine maintains ACID transactional guarantees. Foreign key cascading rules) Tj ET
